 "manufacturer": "Zhuhai Hongjiacheng Technology Co., Ltd",
 "title": "-30 V, -1.9 A P-channel trench MOSFET in SOT-23",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev 2.0",
  "pages": 4
 },
 "summary": "A single P-channel enhancement MOSFET built on a low-voltage trench process, in the three-lead SOT-23. It blocks -30 V and carries -1.9 A continuously at 25 °C ambient, with on-resistance at most 190 mΩ at -10 V of gate drive and 330 mΩ at -4.5 V. The gate threshold lies between -1 V and -3 V. Named uses are battery-powered systems, solid-state relays and direct drive from TTL or CMOS logic.",
