   "topic": "Construction",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "SOT-23 body in a molding compound rated UL 94V-0, RoHS compliant and halogen-free. Leads are solder plated and pass the MIL-STD-750 Method 2026 solderability test. The top face is marked S3."
